#: scenario8:scenario8_4D5B1952_FBB7_450D_B213_2EECB2E8B062
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6738a585b1e4cf1e861398a7a79fb11d0ef2ba9e6ad9a424169dc42feb097055
#. default-sha256: 51862161084c8d36ba526f5fdba4a64f678d7bc47b190727ca9667e2c93e89b0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4D5B1952_FBB7_450D_B213_2EECB2E8B062"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I remember the Silk Road,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫stretching out before me as far as the eye can see,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫我只记得无穷无尽的丝绸之路……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E99D19E3_A167_4F57_A7DA_8791B0F2861E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8c734d13dd716e08b43623645f978650e1ebfbc0724bc3d3f826d27b7a895203
#. default-sha256: 4a69ecda57e0f86ecc5ecb3625b6eea609354b1027165dd35f82539ccbe84bb1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E99D19E3_A167_4F57_A7DA_8791B0F2861E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫clouds of dust wisping across the bare dirt trail."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫沙土和尘埃飞舞，裸露的土路。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_40E7908F_A47F_49C9_A203_5A99E5B51E79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 07f92b6d7a4e96d6807ab2ac3e29d32203b00e1fe4ea32b1af642958445120e2
#. default-sha256: 02975e48ecb5cca154942ad659a608e4a897a3fe1d4445dfb23c8a51d37d8124
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_40E7908F_A47F_49C9_A203_5A99E5B51E79"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But beyond that,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫我……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A4526673_F606_486A_B4A8_F455E5DA6B49
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7de4294b55a2bab24391e0b1055305d60d47b90c8477973887cc3411ec743817
#. default-sha256: 27f9401829324a1bfdfe01ff497558991e1a6d063b245b9d4cc0ab4f589c36af
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A4526673_F606_486A_B4A8_F455E5DA6B49"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I can only clearly remember the last five years or so of my life.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫In my oldest "
"real memory, I was a slave."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫能够回想起的最初的记忆，⟪k:2⟫大概是在五年前。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫我在当奴隶。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_7A6735AE_C1A9_4B70_B191_D290FCD9996A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8388c197cfe8d01a37c04e88f25712707a4516ec8d661ae0c4c40cca386a7d8a
#. default-sha256: 164b3203691534e557fc4a48ca6a1a7e1070fa2a3752426d33456ef95e896648
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7A6735AE_C1A9_4B70_B191_D290FCD9996A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You have no idea what that’s like.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫How it feels to be abused and humiliated,⟪k:3⟫"
"desperate for food and water."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫你应该不会懂吧。⟪k:1⟫被他人欺凌的屈辱和饥饿的痛苦……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B462978E_C7DD_4FDE_A8A9_8D469051BEB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f5fdaa4c179859ed2dc194b5788325dfd143a3037020e748990346ee921d0c06
#. default-sha256: f15e775a867fa436649134b637924f13b88426a69e677776c4203b9419535931
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B462978E_C7DD_4FDE_A8A9_8D469051BEB8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh... ⟪k:1⟫I see.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫So as I was saying..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫不……看来你是明白的。⟪k:1⟫我继续说吧。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_5D6BA232_6825_4A00_A986_8F8C0BFDBBE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32bec2a74fea0c9a99aec9c9cb72a9e1e921ea3badece61cc9551da8c1260fd8
#. default-sha256: a54d1b9230e86b60ea1c58429a79b416c5f4ff0eef320d3e75480346004fed51
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5D6BA232_6825_4A00_A986_8F8C0BFDBBE4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But they were right about what I was deep down—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a beast—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and my revenge "
"went far beyond what could be considered reasonable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫可是……或许从一开始，⟪k:1⟫我就有野兽的本性……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫因为我的行径已经远远超出复仇的范围。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F9F2E4D1_B033_4ECD_A2BC_3268A2155534
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 581f99abb948ed38107ce7be747c76bb978a8f238005c7f348f8f8842c088623
#. default-sha256: 3de720b13b11acc4556855ccb399afbba95338941b08e04f52d8e48175d29c16
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F9F2E4D1_B033_4ECD_A2BC_3268A2155534"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Four years ago,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫那是四年前的事。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_9737F342_11CF_4BCE_8FD4_F42B0B6D45AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0264cb840ae6bd7b04f298d0d4f0a0c626dd1caf8ba26a70077f97819aa12ccf
#. default-sha256: 9dce9f548175102217d0021e5eeb29d7beb12007d64f0612e8176201368811f8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9737F342_11CF_4BCE_8FD4_F42B0B6D45AF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was sitting in a carriage as it rattled along a dirt road. ⟪k:1⟫This was not the kind of "
"carriage you rode around town in, but a filthy slave transport."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫那一天，⟪k:1⟫我坐在马车上。⟪k:2⟫那不是旅行用的马车，⟪k:3⟫而是用来运送奴隶的那种，⟪k:4⟫肮脏又"
"破烂。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0D1D9CD2_9C53_41BC_B3F0_18430F2CAD00
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aac3fcd2a41b887f69b04ed6dfe5edf26f15cb951d1730a9b285aaf850097b22
#. default-sha256: ab840dfe503faac466bcc54a30d50c5be0f36dd0d80fa89abe024f10e2c6be7a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0D1D9CD2_9C53_41BC_B3F0_18430F2CAD00"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There were men, young women, and even children.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Everyone wore a look of "
"hopelessness on their faces,⟪k:3⟫and no one had the strength left to resist."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫有年轻女人，⟪k:1⟫也有小孩子。⟪k:2⟫每个人的脸上都写满绝望。⟪k:3⟫可是没有人有余力抵抗。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_1D886E58_66E2_49FB_9D60_309E65564CB9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0f834d31ed76aef42f40c0b19383dcbda3814ee30c939577b7c3d2e006a3584
